**Out-Loud Brainstorming**

I brainstorm and jump between ideas out loud before focusing on the final solution.
:::

:::icon id=s4_c2_icon at=center width=32 height=32 offsetX=30 offsetY=-160 name=compass size=28 color=#0284C7
:::

:::text id=s4_c2_body at=center width=520 height=170 offsetX=270 offsetY=-65 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC fontSize=18 fill=#1E293B borderRadius=16
**Coherence-Driven**

I easily get irritated when things get incoherent, and sort them out before moving on.
:::

:::icon id=s4_c3_icon at=center width=32 height=32 offsetX=-510 offsetY=70 name=zap size=28 color=#B45309
:::

:::text id=s4_c3_body at=center width=520 height=170 offsetX=-270 offsetY=165 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC fontSize=18 fill=#1E293B borderRadius=16
**Topic-Selective Energy**

Energetic when discussing product/engineering topics; operate with lower energy in other areas.
:::

:::icon id=s4_c4_icon at=center width=32 height=32 offsetX=30 offsetY=70 name=hammer size=28 color=#16A34A
:::

:::text id=s4_c4_body at=center width=520 height=170 offsetX=270 offsetY=165 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC fontSize=18 fill=#1E293B borderRadius=16
**Build & Discover**

Love to build and run product discovery simultaneously, rather than waiting for fully baked ideas.
:::
